-What a release changes decides its number. A patch (`vX.Y.Z`, Z above 0) changes nothing the box image runs or relies on since its minor `vX.Y.0`: the list is `IMAGE_RUNS` in `docs/devteam/scripts/devteam.mjs`, and `devteam.mjs box-pins changed --since vX.Y.0 --smoke`, run in a checkout of the release, says `kind: patch`. Anything else is a minor (`vX.Y.0`), whether it fixes or adds. A minor has a release-prep PR (`box-pins bump --release vX.Y.0`) and deploys the box; a patch keeps its minor's stamp, has none, and lands in place (the deploy gate, above).
+What a release changes decides its number. A patch (`vX.Y.Z`, Z above 0) changes nothing the box image runs or relies on since its minor `vX.Y.0`: the list is `IMAGE_RUNS` in `docs/devteam/scripts/lib/box-pins.mjs`, and `devteam.mjs box-pins changed --since vX.Y.0 --smoke`, run in a checkout of the release, says `kind: patch`. Anything else is a minor (`vX.Y.0`), whether it fixes or adds. A minor has a release-prep PR (`box-pins bump --release vX.Y.0`) and deploys the box; a patch keeps its minor's stamp, has none, and lands in place (the deploy gate, above).
